  {
   "text": "This Steam demo is sixteen\npoint nine gigabytes.\nThree people made it.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.303,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven hundred and seventy\nmegabytes of that download\nis a file they forgot to\ndelete.",
   "start": 4.553,
   "duration": 4.904,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Expedition: Into\nDarkness, a medieval\nextraction crawler. You go\ndown, you take what you\ncan carry, you try to get\nback out.",
   "start": 13.707,
   "duration": 7.699,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Five player co-op,\npermadeath, and about a\nthousand people in it\nright now.",
   "start": 21.656,
   "duration": 4.539,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. That seven\nhundred and seventy\nmegabytes is debug\nsymbols. They belong on a\nbuild server, not in your\ndownload.",
